note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note omegallm serve.om (aien-train DRA-119 + Workstream 3 scaling):
note `ollm serve PORT CK MERGES [MAXCONN] [tplmax=N] [test=1] [slots=N] [ctx=N] [kvcache=N] [kvblks=N] [strand=PATH ...]`
note Production OpenAI-compatible HTTP/1.1 server on 127.0.0.1:PORT with:
note  - Continuous-batching multi-slot concurrent scheduler (slots=1..8, default 8; true 503 only when saturated)
note  - Paged shared-trunk KV prefix cache (SV_BLK=8) across base, single strands, and spclip S=2..4 strands
note    with FNV-1a-64 prefix chain hashing + exact 8-token verification and bounded LRU leaf eviction
note  - Long-context serving up to 32,768 tokens (ctx=T_ck..32768, default 8192; clean 400 over limit)
note aarch64/gb10 only: build.sh composes it under one `om2` line after net/{http,json,jsonw}.om.
note Wait/pending: 32 pending slots, 10 s silent timeout; head 10 s / body 60 s idle (0.5 s / 5 s when active).
note tplmax=N (256 .. 983040, default 524288) caps the chat template in bytes; test=1 enables test-only fields
note (ollm_test_output, ollm_test_delay_ms, ollm_test_collide).
note Routes: GET /health, GET /v1/models, POST /v1/chat/completions, POST /v1/completions,
note GET /v1/neuralese/info, POST /v1/neuralese/trace.
note Exit codes: 2 usage; 27 merges (bpe.om); 60/61/62 strand pack check/tamper/mismatch; 71 port bind.
note wb layout: raw token bytes [0, 8192), content [8192, 73728), stop strings [73728, 74752) (8 x
note 128), markers [74752, 74784), message [81920, 82176), response id [82176, 82240), call id
note [82240, 82432), tool names [82432, 90624) (128 x 64), template [90624, 1073664). bd holds the
note request, then the tool calls' names and arguments [0, 131072). sv slots: 0 stream, 1 max
note tokens, 2 TEMPMILLI, 3 seed state, 4 include_usage, 5 template bytes, 6 CT0, 7 generated, 8
note finish, 9 request count, 10 created, 11 start ns, 12 raw bytes, 13 content bytes, 14 content
note sent, 15 id length, 16 error code, 17 chunk end, 19 max_ctx, 21 last status, 22 test mode, 23
note tplmax, 24 forced tokens, 25 forced on, 26 test output bytes, 27 delay ms, 28 top_k, 29 top_p
note millionths, 30 tools, 31 tool detection, 32 tool calls, 33 marker position, 34 bd fill,
note 35 stop strings, 36 listen fd, 37 /v1/completions mode, 38 route (0 base, 1..4 strand k, 5 spclip),
note 39 spclip_mode, 40 spclip_mode_set, 41 spclip_weights_set, 42 cache_on, 43 cached_tokens,
note 44 collide_mode, 45 strand_set.
note
note Mutants (tests/omegallm/build.sh --mutant NAME sets one constant to 0):
